OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stan Tracey
OL,6,     F3/5. Kate Molleson is joined by
OL,7,     FClark Tracey to explore the life
OL,8,     Fand work of his father, Stan
OL,9,     FTracey. Following Stan into the
OL,10,     F1970s as he dips his toe into the
OL,11,     Fwaters of free jazz.
OL,12,G1700 In Tune
OL,13,     FKatie welcomes Violin star Joshua
OL,14,     FBell to the studio. The Ferio
OL,15,     FSaxophone Quartet play live from
OL,16,     Ftheir new album.
OL,17,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,18,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,20,     Ffavourites.
